</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20121105212507&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Disintegrate_Rune_3f18a3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a disintegrate rune (\"adito tera\").<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be used by monks, druids, sorcerers, paladins, knights with level 21 and magic level 4 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.70 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Destroys movable objects.<br/>Very useful, try to have some in your <a href=\"#/wiki/Backpack\">backpack</a> if you are in a PvP world because it may help save you from a PK trap. You need to stand next to the item(s) you want to disintegrate. It will disintegrate up to 500 movable items (it will not disintegrate any dead human body, but it will disintegrate monster bodies). It does not count as an aggressive action, and therefore works in <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Zone\">Protection Zones</a> and does not prevent the player from entering them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div 